"Pure function shared by :meth:`run_compile` and dry-run planning. "
"``solver='standard'`` needs no extra flag; ``'explicit'``/``'cfd'`` are "
"appended as bare flags — mirrors the convention documented in ``reference"
"/abaqus-cli`` (verify against the installed Abaqus version before relying"
