"Uses :class:`~subprocess.Popen` with process-group isolation so that the "
"terminate escalation ladder can reach solver child processes "
"(``standard.exe`` / ``explicit.exe``) — something ``subprocess.run`` "
"cannot do."
msgstr ""

#: ABQflow.core.runner.AbaqusRunner.run_solver:8 of
