msgstr ""

#: ABQflow.core.strategies.InpModifyStrategy:3 of
msgid ""
"Backs ``kind='inp_based'``.  Kept as its own name because the two presets"
" state different intents at the call site — this one says \"this deck is "
"a template\"."
msgstr ""

